Lumenora Licensing Notice
=========================

This repository is NOT licensed as a single, unified work. It contains two
clearly distinct sets of software with different license terms:

  A) Lumenora's own, original files   ->  MIT License (see below)
  B) Bundled / upstream third-party    ->  NOT licensed by this repository;
                                           each component keeps its own license

Keep this separation in mind. Nothing in this file grants you a license to
any third-party software that Lumenora's builds incorporate; for those you
must consult the license of each component as described in section (B).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
(A) Lumenora's OWN work — MIT License
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This section applies ONLY to the files in this repository that were written
by this project itself, namely:

  - the BlueBuild recipe definitions: `recipes/recipe.yml`,
    `recipes/recipe-nvidia.yml`, `recipes/recipe-nvidia-open.yml`;
  - the build scripts and configuration this project authors, under `files/`
    and `scripts/` (including the Lumen Plasma theme, MangoHud/GameMode/gamescope
    configuration, skel dotfiles, and the GPU-detection tooling under
    `files/usr/`);
  - the `Containerfile`, `installer/` definitions, and the GitHub Actions
    workflows under `.github/`.

It does NOT cover any file copied or derived from upstream, and it does NOT
cover the Lumenora operating-system image or installer ISO that these build
definitions produce.

